      "writtenOn": "2021-04-22T21:51:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi, Aseda, can you please elaborate your concern/question? Why shouldn\u0027t \"the mux settings affect SBU if we\u0027re using a debug accessory\"?",
      "parentUuid": "98801375_cf0528f1",
      "range": {
